cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Freiburg Brain Immune Data Viewer"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that converts collections of Seurat and RaceID objects into
  cloud-optimised AnnData-Zarr stores and generates a static Vitessce viewer
  over them, so published single-cell and spatial datasets can be browsed
  without a backend server.
type: software
license: MIT
